<title>HONG KONG: Toy Options optimistic on 1995/96 earnings.</title>
<headline>Toy Options optimistic on 1995/96 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Toy Options Group Plc is optimistic about 1995/96 earnings, Chairman Richard King said on Wednesday during a visit to Hong Kong.</p>
<p>For the year ending August 31, 1995, the toy distributor reported profit of 1.69 million stg (US$2.6 million) on turnover of 22.6 million stg.</p>
<p>&quot;For the year ending August 31, 1996, three brokers who follow Toy Options estimate this year's profits at 3.3 to 3.4 million pounds,&quot; King told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't see any reason why those estimates wouldn't be fulfilled,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
</text>
